{"ID":"20240205172224-ofmy0da","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205172224-ofmy0da","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172224-ofmy0da\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172236-qruuzjn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611163436-f0ty0gq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:783,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611163916-jsg0bu6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"188白薇","type":"doc","updated":"20240820110705"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172236-qruuzjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172236-qruuzjn","updated":"20240205172250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產遼寧、河北、河南、山東、山西、安徽等地。\n【性狀】\t根莖粗短，有結節，多彎曲。上面有圓形的莖痕，下面及兩側簇生多數細長的根，根長1025cm，直徑0.10.2cm。表面棕黃色。質脆，易折斷，斷面皮部黃白色，木部黃色。氣微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t味苦、鹹，寒。\n【功效】\t清熱涼血，利尿通淋，解毒療瘡。用於溫邪傷營發熱，陰虛發熱，骨蒸勞熱，產後血虛發熱，熱淋，血淋，癰疽腫毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172234-dkwikm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172234-dkwikm2","updated":"20240820105403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172234-hxo18cm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820105659-67n48cg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820105659-67n48cg","updated":"20240820105713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 341px;","style":"width: 331px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/萆薢 17-20240820105525-4ka05b2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 331px;\" parent-style=\"width: 341px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 546px;","style":"width: 536px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇-20240820105613-m3fgqa8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 536px;\" parent-style=\"width: 546px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇-20240625110555-ggoe204.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 363px;\" parent-style=\"width: 373px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625110705-wpcy6w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625110705-wpcy6w9","updated":"20240820110229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 4-20240820110146-2w4nvb9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 5-20240820110228-x97126m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 386px;","style":"width: 376px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇2-20240625110705-xex2nna.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 376px;\" parent-style=\"width: 386px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820110303-q7nqzrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820110303-q7nqzrq","updated":"20240820110553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 6-20240820110303-v7btlzj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 9-20240820110553-zr61xjl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820105928-vpvmwmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820105928-vpvmwmt","updated":"20240820105931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 660px;","style":"width: 650px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇5-20240625111025-ug3x3s7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 650px;\" parent-style=\"width: 660px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 3-20240820105928-kfhq53l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820110421-sac6wgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820110421-sac6wgf","updated":"20240820110508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 695px;","style":"width: 685px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 7-20240820110421-202hbl8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 685px;\" parent-style=\"width: 695px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 589px;","style":"width: 579px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 8-20240820110508-517rwgi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 579px;\" parent-style=\"width: 589px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820105820-xoeu5hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820105820-xoeu5hq","updated":"20240820110705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 2-20240820105820-hah2zu8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白薇 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白薇 10-20240820110705-knwhy0c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611163426-x584afw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163426-x584afw"}},{"ID":"20240611163722-syospj6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163722-syospj6","updated":"20240611163727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163722-8sztxys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163722-8sztxys","updated":"20240611163722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163722-bxjqb2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163722-bxjqb2f","updated":"20240611163722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主暴中风，身热肢满，忽忽不知人，狂惑，邪气，寒热酸痋，温疟、洗洗发作有时。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163722-b2q4vd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163722-b2q4vd6","updated":"20240611163722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名白幕，一名薇草，一名春草，一名骨美，生平原，三月三日，采根阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163804-rekl7ce","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163804-rekl7ce"}},{"ID":"20240611163806-lyxyol0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163806-lyxyol0","updated":"20240611163817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163806-7tasf1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163806-7tasf1w","updated":"20240611163810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇，生平原川谷，今陕西诸郡及滁、舒、润、辽州亦有之。茎叶俱青，颇类柳叶；六、七月开红花；八月结实；根黄白色，类牛膝而短小；三月三日采根，阴干用。今云八月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163854-w7blj5d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163854-w7blj5d"}},{"ID":"20240611163855-p6yo5s9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163855-p6yo5s9","updated":"20240611163859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163855-eia1ogo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163855-eia1ogo","updated":"20240611163855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀天地之阴气以生，故味苦咸平，大寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163855-cxuw0zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163855-cxuw0zc","updated":"20240611163855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇苦咸而寒，入心肾，利阴气，下水气。中风身热皮满、温疟寒热酸疼，狂惑鬼疰堪却，伤中淋露可除。利气益精，下水渗湿，风温灼热，多眠遗尿，热淋血厥。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163915-qdqai0j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163915-qdqai0j"}},{"ID":"20240611163916-jsg0bu6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163916-jsg0bu6","updated":"20240611163921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163916-1zspm1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163916-1zspm1i","updated":"20240611163916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦咸平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163916-4jxo8fz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163916-4jxo8fz","updated":"20240611163916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主暴中风，身热肢满，忽忽不知人，狂惑邪气，寒热酸疼，温疟洗洗，发作有时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163916-fl5k4q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163916-fl5k4q1","updated":"20240611163916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇咸平降泄，抑阳扶阴，为足阳明经本药，兼行足少阴、手太阴。《本经》主暴中风身热肢满，是热郁生风，痰随火涌，故令忽忽不知人，狂惑邪气，寒热酸疼，皆热邪所致。温疟乃冬时伏邪，至春而发，缪氏《经疏》言，暑邪所伤，秋必发为温疟，恐非经旨。《别录》疗伤中淋露者，女子伤犯阴中营血，而成淋露之疾，用以除热益阴，则前证瘳矣。下水气利阴气者，总取益阴之功，真阴益而邪水下。性善降泄，故久服利人。《金匮》治妇人产中虚烦、呕逆，安中益气，竹皮丸中用之。《千金》治风温发汗后身灼热，自汗，身重，多眠，鼻息必鼾，语言难出，葳蕤汤中用之。又治妇人遗尿，不拘胎前产后，有白薇芍药汤，取其有补阴之功。而兼行手太阴，以清膀胱之上源，殊非虚寒不禁之比也。古方多用治妇人者，以《别录》有疗伤中淋露之功也。凡胃虚少食，泄泻及喘咳多汗，阳气外泄者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163905-iiikjfu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163905-iiikjfu"}},{"ID":"20240611163906-im2gx3c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163906-im2gx3c","updated":"20240611163910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163906-vmny320","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163906-vmny320","updated":"20240611163906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏黄 、干姜、大枣、山茱萸、大黄、大戟、干漆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163906-qpkv8k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163906-qpkv8k5","updated":"20240611163906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦、咸、寒。阳明冲任之药。利阴气，下水气。治风温灼热，自汗身重，多眠鼻鼾，语言难出，及温疟血厥，热淋遗尿。得白芍，治血淋热淋，及妇人遗尿。（不拘胎前产后。）配贝母、冬花、百部，治肺实鼻塞。配石膏、竹茹、甘草、桂枝，治胎前虚烦呕逆。佐人参、当归、甘草，治血厥。（出汗过多，血少阳气独上，气塞不行，故身如死。气过血还，阴阳复通，故移时方寤。妇人尤多此症。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163906-kg798cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163906-kg798cw","updated":"20240611163906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去须酒洗，或糯米泔浸一宿，蒸用。血虚气弱者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163842-p8m04if","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163842-p8m04if"}},{"ID":"20240611163843-3r3rk5o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163843-3r3rk5o","updated":"20240611163849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163843-dsjobke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163843-dsjobke","updated":"20240611163843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻血热"}]},{"ID":"20240611163843-gmuwsgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163843-gmuwsgg","updated":"20240611163843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦咸而寒，阴阳、冲、任之药。利阴气，下水气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163843-i4vh8z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163843-i4vh8z6","updated":"20240611163843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主中风身热支满，忽忽不知人（阴虚火旺，则内热主风。火气焚灼，故身热支满。痰随火涌，故不知人），血厥（汗出过多血少，阳气独上，气塞不行而厥，妇人尤多。此证宜白薇汤，白薇、当归各一两，参五钱，甘草钱半，每服五钱）热淋，温疟洒洒，寒热酸痛（寒热作，则营气不能内营，故酸痛），妇人伤中淋露（血热。千金白薇散治胎前产后遗尿不知时，白薇、芍药等分，酒调服。丹溪曰∶此即河间所谓热甚廷孔郁结，神无所依，不能收禁之意也。廷孔，女人溺孔也），产虚烦呕（仲景安中益气竹皮丸用之。《经疏》曰∶古方调经种子，往往用之。盖不孕缘于血热血少，而其源起于真阴不足，阳胜而内热，故营血日枯也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163843-1v3v0z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163843-1v3v0z4","updated":"20240611163843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"益阴清热，则血自生旺而有子矣，须佐以归、地、芍药、杜仲、苁蓉等药）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163843-3iyzl4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163843-3iyzl4q","updated":"20240611163843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"似牛膝而短小柔软。去须酒洗用。恶大黄、大戟、山茱、姜、枣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163823-7i7pp0m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163823-7i7pp0m"}},{"ID":"20240611163824-qeai7gg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163824-qeai7gg","updated":"20240611163829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163824-si3r9z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163824-si3r9z3","updated":"20240611163824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦．入阳明经．功专治暴中风．身热肢满．忽忽不知人．狂惑邪气．寒热酸疼温疟．得桂枝、石膏、竹茹治胎前虚烦呕逆．得人参、当归、甘草治产后血厥昏冒．酒洗用．恶大黄、大戟、山茱、姜枣．"}]},{"ID":"20240611163754-6bdiwez","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163754-6bdiwez"}},{"ID":"20240611163755-704zf49","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163755-704zf49","updated":"20240611163759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《顾松园医镜》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163755-ojdrjw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163755-ojdrjw7","updated":"20240611163755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔苦咸大寒，入胃经。〕治中风支满神昏，〔阴虚火旺，热极则生风。火气燔灼，故心下支满，痰随火涌，故神昏不知，益阴除热则愈。〕除邪气寒热酸疼。〔热邪伤人，阴气不足，则阳独盛而为热；心肾俱虚，则热收于内而为寒；寒热作则荣气不能内荣，而肢体酸疼，是热淫于内，故治以咸寒。〕遗溺血淋俱用，〔皆热在下焦所致，益阴除热自安。〕调经种子宜征。〔经水先期，乃因血热，不孕，多由阴虚内热，荣血日枯之故。益阴除热，则血自生旺，而令能孕矣。〕凡天行热病后，余热未除，及温疟瘅疟，久而不能解者，必属阴虚，除疟邪药中，类中风除热药中，俱宜宜加入。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163755-jv6dtpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163755-jv6dtpz","updated":"20240611163755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中寒泄泻者勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163744-g8fiui3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163744-g8fiui3"}},{"ID":"20240611163745-kd72p91","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163745-kd72p91","updated":"20240611163749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163745-7i0pjzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163745-7i0pjzs","updated":"20240611163745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（山草）泻肺燥热"}]},{"ID":"20240611163745-0d0nvzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163745-0d0nvzs","updated":"20240611163745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇（专入肺）。味苦而咸。性寒无毒。凡人阴虚火动。则内热生风。火气焚灼。身体壮热。支满痰涌。忽不知人。与夫汗出血厥。酸痛淋闭。其在妇人。则或廷孔郁结。（廷孔。妇人溺孔也。）神无所依。而见淋露不净。并血枯热胜。而见虚烦上呕。非不用此苦泄咸降利水。使阴气自上而下。则热何由泄乎？是以金匮安中益气竹皮丸。用此以治妇人产中虚烦呕逆。（经疏云。古方调经种子。往往用之益不孕。缘于血热而少其源。起于真阴不足。阳胜而内热。故营血日枯也。益阴清热。则自生旺而有子矣。须佐以归地芍药杜仲苁蓉等药。）千金葳蕤汤。用此以治风温身热汗出身重。又有白薇芍药汤。以治妇人遗尿。（白薇芍药等分。酒调服。）不拘胎前产后。皆能补阴平阳而兼行肺。以清膀胱上源。并非虚寒不禁之比也。但胃虚泄泻。阳气外越者禁用。似牛膝而短小柔软。去须酒洗用。恶大黄大戟山茱姜枣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163733-p1z1ekr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163733-p1z1ekr"}},{"ID":"20240611163734-hel4ko0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163734-hel4ko0","updated":"20240611163738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163734-53bm59f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163734-53bm59f","updated":"20240611163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦咸平，无毒。主治暴中风，身热肢满，忽忽不知人，狂惑邪气，寒热酸疼，温疟洗洗，发作有时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163734-3ld81vp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163734-3ld81vp","updated":"20240611163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（白薇《本经》名春生，出陕西及舒、滁、润、辽诸处。其根黄白色，类牛膝，而短小柔软可曲者，白薇也。坚直易断者，白前也。《乘雅》云∶根似牛膝而细长尺许，色黄微白，芳白微黄，折之易断者，白前也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163734-z5nwdlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163734-z5nwdlp","updated":"20240611163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡草木皆感春气而生，唯《本经》号白薇为春生。谓其能启水天之精气，随春气而生升也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163734-6nzx6fp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163734-6nzx6fp","updated":"20240611163734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦者火也。禀太阳寒水之气在下，标阳之气在上也。根色黄白，又阳明秋金之气，而秋金之气，合肺气于皮毛，亦太阳之所主也。太阳标阳之气，行于肌表，故主治暴中风。太阳寒水之气，周于一身，故主治身热。肢满，风邪淫于四末也。忽忽，眩晕貌。忽忽不知人，风邪行于头目也。夫风者，百病之长，善行数变。狂惑邪气，风淫血分而涉于心包矣。寒热酸痛，风淫肌腠而涉于经脉矣。白薇禀秋金之气，故治诸风之变证。先热后寒，名曰温疟。温疟洗洗，如水洒身之寒也。温疟发作有时，白薇禀寒水之气，上行外达，故治温疟。又得太阳之标阳，故治温疟之洗洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163426-vm8y5cv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163426-vm8y5cv"}},{"ID":"20240611163610-lndi8nn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-lndi8nn","updated":"20240611163614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-v534by0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-v534by0","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近道皆有。其根黄白色。类牛膝而短小。八月采之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-do2yiys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-do2yiys","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒平。乃阳明经药。主治暴中风。身热肢满。忽忽不知人。狂惑邪气。寒热酸疼。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-8ma4csa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-8ma4csa","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗温疟洗洗发作有时。及风温灼热多眠。伤中淋露。下水气。利阴气。方书治螈虚烦。小便不禁。温疟瘅疟。久而不解者。必属阴虚。除疟邪药中。多加白薇主之则易瘳。凡人阴气不足。则能冬不能夏。更为暑邪所伤。秋来发疟。先热后寒曰温疟。或但热不寒为瘅疟。未有不由阴精不守而得者。若果阴精内守。则暑不能侵。疟何自作。凡治似中风证除热药中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-xw3wqsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-xw3wqsk","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亦宜加而用之。天行热病得愈。或愈后阴虚内热。及余热未除者。随证随经药中。宜加之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-7xrjrxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-7xrjrxl","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风温发汗后。身体灼热。自汗壮实者。服葳蕤汤。（中用白薇）风温自汗出。脉阴阳俱浮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-v2c6lvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-v2c6lvg","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身重多眠。鼻息必鼾。语言难出。此正风虚之证也。宜防己汤。防己为君。佐以参术草生姜治之。风虚昏愦。不自觉知。手足螈。或为寒热。此证血虚不能服发汗药。独活汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-dqaxx39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-dqaxx39","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇人参当归茯神远志桂心菖蒲川芎甘草以治风虚血虚。兼用半夏细辛羌独防风以除虚风。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-ctw17rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-ctw17rl","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺实鼻塞。不知香臭。白薇贝母款冬花一两。百部二两。为末。每服一钱。米饮下。妇人产中虚。烦乱呕逆。安中益气。竹皮丸主之。竹皮石膏三分。白薇桂枝一分。甘草七分。枣肉为大丸。每以饮化一丸服。有热者倍白薇。此以甘草为主。而更丸以枣肉者。取责于本也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-4qa08jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-4qa08jp","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有热则倍白薇。正欲其归阳于阴。以化阳分之邪。而作转关之用尔。产后胃弱不食。脉微。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-lhzoyuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-lhzoyuy","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多汗亡血。发厥郁冒等证。用白薇汤。白薇当归各六钱。人参半之。甘草又半之。妇人血厥。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-r222erh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-r222erh","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平居无疾苦。忽如死人。目闭口噤。或微知人。眩冒移时方寤。（亦名郁冒）此因出汗过多。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-vccrhvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-vccrhvg","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血少。阳气独上。气塞不行。（故身如死）气过血还。阴阳复通。（故移时方寤）宜服白薇汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-3vtccm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-3vtccm6","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调经种子。用白薇为君。佐以地黄白芍当归苁蓉山萸杜仲白胶黄柏天麦冬丹参。蜜丸。久服易孕。凡不孕缘于血少血热。其原必起于真阴不足。阳胜而内热。内热则荣血日枯。是以不孕。益阴除热。则血自生旺矣。胎前遗尿。白薇散。用白薇白芍二味。等分服之。女子宫冷不孕。有白薇丸二方。又胜金丸秦桂丸中俱用之。（可知别录大寒之说不信）〔论〕白薇花于夏末。实于秋中。而采根即以八月。味苦咸平。盖取其由阳归阴之性味以为用。本经言其气平足据也。别录利阴气一语。正于本经主治可作注脚。其治风证。举风淫风虚而皆宜。如同于羌独防风石膏辈治风之淫。则葳蕤汤是。同于参术草治风之虚。则防己汤是也。大约能归阳于阴。以化阳分之邪。而作转关之用。观于血厥郁冒。病由出汗过多。阳气独上。气塞不行。宜主白薇。则知归阳之义不妄也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163610-16aro3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163610-16aro3b","updated":"20240611163610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕酒洗用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163619-dkeowja","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163619-dkeowja"}},{"ID":"20240611163620-mybeyjx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163620-mybeyjx","updated":"20240611163625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163620-w3ivk00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163620-w3ivk00","updated":"20240611163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦咸。性平。无毒。禀天地之阴气以生。降也。阴也。恶黄、大黄、大戟、干姜、大枣、干漆、山萸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163620-gxwzbv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163620-gxwzbv5","updated":"20240611163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主暴中风身热支满。忽忽不知人。狂惑邪气。寒热酸疼。温疟洒洒。发作有时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163620-a4r3yns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163620-a4r3yns","updated":"20240611163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（灼热【归经】入胃经。为清虚火除血热之品。（阳明冲任要药）【前论】海藏曰。古方多用白薇治妇人病。仲淳曰。别录治伤中淋露者。女子荣气不足则血火旺鳌按、白薇并能除血癖。曾治一妇人。本系产后身热烦呕之症。余用白薇为君。加芎、归、微觉点。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163620-cddwhm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163620-cddwhm1","updated":"20240611163620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】经疏曰。凡汗多亡阳。或内虚不思食。食不消。及下后内虚。腹中觉冷。或因下太【炮制】雷公曰。去须。糯米泔浸一宿。细锉。蒸拌。日晒干用。（酒洗亦可）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163646-5mhgsqu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163646-5mhgsqu"}},{"ID":"20240611163647-npd8vv4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-npd8vv4","updated":"20240611163652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-wvcu7a9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-wvcu7a9","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-10kl132","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-10kl132","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"惟其卒暴，故不觉其所从来。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-1sffugi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-1sffugi","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦咸平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-vjvbu3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-vjvbu3c","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主暴中风，身热，支满，忽忽不知人，狂惑邪气，寒热酸疼，温疟洗洗，发作有时"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-0jxcgpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-0jxcgpv","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶出陕西，及舒、滁、润、辽诸州，近以山东沂濮、莒莱诸州者称胜。茎叶俱青，颇类柳叶。六、七月开红色花，遂结实。根似牛膝而细，长尺许。色黄微白，芳香袭人者，白薇也；色白微黄，折之易断者，白前也。修治，用糯米泔浸一宿，去髭，槐砧上锉细，蒸之，从申至巳，晒干用。恶黄 、大黄、大戟、干姜、大枣、干漆、山茱萸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-t6jqndw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-t6jqndw","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰；白薇，别名白幕。白者，金色，坚刚之体也。微者，隐也，隐身而行。幕者，军行之幕，以隐身也。此指能治因所治证，以诠名耳。气平，味苦咸，平则不上不下，敦土德化，御所不胜也。炎上作苦，苦性走下，苦能入骨，润下作咸，咸性走血，咸能 坚，从巅及踵，沦肤彻髓，靡不周到者也。谓所胜因，善行数变，亦靡不周遍故也。故主因于暴风，隐身而为身热肢满，忽忽不知人，狂惑邪气，寒热酸疼，此风气留其处，故隐身而尝在也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163647-vh8h9sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163647-vh8h9sl","updated":"20240611163647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或隐身而行，而为温疟洒洒，发作有时，此风并卫居，随卫气之昼行于阳，夜行于阴，沉以内薄，故发有期，而时作时休也。此皆暴风数变之证，金以制之，制所胜也。别录主淋露遗尿，即风隐膀胱也。若水气精损，即风隐于肾，致令肾虚精涸，肾虚水泛也。若忽如死人，即风隐于血，致令血厥也。若温病多眠，即风隐于脉道，致令卫气不得昼行于阳也。若痉则风隐于筋，惊则风行致令气上也。咸以暴风为因，寒则非所宜矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163658-cafr17g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163658-cafr17g"}},{"ID":"20240611163659-po2altg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163659-po2altg","updated":"20240611163703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163659-zfi3cpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163659-zfi3cpd","updated":"20240611163659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇咸苦大寒平，中风忽忽睡多惊，止疟能祛邪魅惑，益阴精止淋露频。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163659-pc6lptd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163659-pc6lptd","updated":"20240611163659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色白而形微细。无毒。主暴中风身热支满，忽忽睡不知人，止温疟。治百邪鬼魅狂惑，寒热酸疼，益阴精。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163659-y4g268f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163659-y4g268f","updated":"20240611163659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗伤中淋露不断，及女子带下，兼下水气。出陕西。米泔浸去须蒸。恶黄 、大黄、大戟、干姜、干漆、山茱萸、大枣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163705-7wse9zo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163705-7wse9zo"}},{"ID":"20240611163711-aucpvzd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-aucpvzd","updated":"20240611163716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-ks6dj0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-ks6dj0o","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名薇草、白幕、春草、、骨美。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-lqqpavn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-lqqpavn","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（根）苦、咸、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-rxz28g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-rxz28g4","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-1zlvpl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-1zlvpl5","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、肺实鼻塞，不知香臭。用白薇、款冬花、贝母各一两，百部二两，共研为末。每服一钱，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-nihmfkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-nihmfkw","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、妇女遗尿（不拘胎前产后）。用白薇、芍药各一两，共研为末，每服一茶匙，酒送下。一天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-j8hm5zu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-j8hm5zu","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、血淋、热淋。治法同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-mga01yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-mga01yq","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、妇女血阙（平时无病，突然昏倒，目闭口禁，过很久才醒悟过来，这种病叫“血阙”，也叫“郁冒”）。用白薇、当归各一两，人参半两，甘草一钱半。每服五钱，加水二碗煮成一碗，温服。此方名“白薇汤”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-4jrfz8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-4jrfz8l","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、刀伤。用白薇研末敷伤口。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163711-r0xl97i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163711-r0xl97i","updated":"20240611163711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、妇女产中虚烦呕逆。用白薇同桂树一分，竹皮石膏三分，甘草七分，加枣肉调成丸子。每服一丸，米汤送下。用热者白薇用量加倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163631-3kyaydb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163631-3kyaydb"}},{"ID":"20240611163632-ne1zltm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163632-ne1zltm","updated":"20240611163640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163632-mjshtf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163632-mjshtf0","updated":"20240611163632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸苦入阳明．寒能胜热．芳香走血分．凉可除蒸．利水益阴．兼治癃淋成闭．产虚烦呕．并医血热生风．（白薇其根色白．微细如丝．故名．味苦而咸．性寒而香．故能清解血分热邪．凡一切时邪温病．热传营分．下午为盛者．最宜．其所以益阴利水者．亦热退则阴生．阴生则水利也．能入阳明者．因金匮竹皮大丸一方．用白薇以治产虚烦呕之胃病耳．白薇花于夏．实于秋．采根于秋末．有由阳转阴之意．故治表热．解风温．皆由里阴不守而来．皆可用此治愈者．亦阳归阴之义．其所以能利水者．因其根似牛膝．有引热下行之意．亦由阳归阴也．"}]},{"ID":"20240611163426-7kar64t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163426-7kar64t"}},{"ID":"20240611163556-54ejz4u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163556-54ejz4u","updated":"20240611163600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163556-r7w5vfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163556-r7w5vfd","updated":"20240611163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。主暴中风。身热肢满。忽忽不知人。狂惑邪气。寒热酸痛。温疟洗洗。发作有时。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163556-ad8n0aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163556-ad8n0aq","updated":"20240611163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春草纤微。分阴属妇。红颤轻花。青归细柳。烦洗清凉。狂回攻掊。禊节三三。秉兰共友。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163556-d9xytm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163556-d9xytm8","updated":"20240611163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尔雅。春草也。李时珍曰。微音相近。微细也。其根细而白也。王好古曰。古方多用以治妇人。易。分阴分阳。诗。至于属妇。苏颂曰。根叶俱青。颇类柳叶。六七月。开红花。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163556-r4loqy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163556-r4loqy7","updated":"20240611163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苏轼诗。清凉洗烦煎。宋濂诗。良剂急攻掊。名医曰。三月三日采根。韩诗外传。郑国之俗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163556-pzmrjjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163556-pzmrjjm","updated":"20240611163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上巳秉兰草。祓除不祥。宋书志。魏以后但用三月三日。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163427-osiy1mx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163427-osiy1mx"}},{"ID":"20240611163545-4jfzxlh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163545-4jfzxlh","updated":"20240611163551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163545-yl59vou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163545-yl59vou","updated":"20240611163545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇，味苦、咸，气平、大寒，无毒。入心、脾二经。主中风身热腹满，忽忽不知人事。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163545-dihx1ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163545-dihx1ep","updated":"20240611163545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗温疟，寒热酸疼洒洒，发作有时。狂惑鬼邪堪却，伤中淋露可除。利气益精，下水渗湿。此佐使要药，非君臣主药也。用之必须用参、苓、柴、术，始可奏功。然又不可出二钱之外，以其大寒损胃也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163545-usfoad8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163545-usfoad8","updated":"20240611163545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问白薇却邪定神，是有益于正气之药，多用何伤？夫邪病多热，白薇寒以解热而却邪，非补正消邪也。大寒之物，多乃损胃，所以戒之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163545-ppposfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163545-ppposfq","updated":"20240611163545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问白薇功用止此乎？夫白薇功用不止此，而其尤效者，善能杀虫。用之于补阴之中，乃能杀劳瘵之虫也。用之健脾开胃之中，乃能杀寸白蛔虫也。以火焚之，可以辟蝇断虱；以酒敷之，可以愈疥而敛疮也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163427-5jsvrh0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163427-5jsvrh0"}},{"ID":"20240611163434-hkrkda7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-hkrkda7","updated":"20240611163439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-1hcti5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-1hcti5z","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为萝藦科植物白薇的根及根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-7f8u4to","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-7f8u4to","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】苦、咸，寒。入肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-odbuj7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-odbuj7g","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】清热凉血。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-0cvzwh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-0cvzwh2","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于热病邪入营血、身热经久不退，肺热咳嗽，以及阴虚内热、产后虚热等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-avzg65w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-avzg65w","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白薇既能清实热，又能清虚热，故能治疗上述诸症。在临床上，一般用于清虚热者居多，常与青蒿、银柴胡等配伍同用；治肺热咳嗽，可与前胡、枇杷叶等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-dlfssro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-dlfssro","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，本品还有利尿作用，可用治小便赤涩热痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-enquq81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-enquq81","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】嫩白薇、香白薇（洗净，晒干，切碎用）"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-c4g6b0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-c4g6b0s","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至三钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-f9jmk5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-f9jmk5o","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【按语】白薇是一味清血热的药物，与银柴胡、地骨皮、青蒿等的功效相近，都能用于清虚热，故这四味药之间，经常配合应用。但本品长于清解，能透邪外达，这一点与青蒿相似；而银柴胡、地骨皮仅能清血热于内，不能透达血热于外。本品又能清泄肺热，可用治肺热咳嗽，这一点与地骨皮相似；而银柴胡、青蒿则无此作用。又白薇尚有利尿作用，尤为它的特点。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163434-uxd9uz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163434-uxd9uz9","updated":"20240611163434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】白薇汤《本事方》：白薇、当归、人参、甘草。治产后血虚发热晕厥，亦治一般虚热。"}]},{"ID":"20240611163435-b9037kk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611163435-b9037kk"}},{"ID":"20240611163436-f0ty0gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611163436-f0ty0gq"}}]}